    # We have lost counts, recompute:
    # collect again pieces sizes embedded in symbols order: tokens count = ?
    # Use heuristic: token entries are those before first nonterm rule name in rules that isn't token. Hard; approximate as count of symbols that are not in nonterm names and not aux
